AX4D A7 wavetable synthesizer (size-trimmed)
============================================

Runs on Cortex-A7 (`BES2003_AUDIO`). Loads single-cycle wavetables from TF
card and plays through `/dev/audio/pcm0p` (RPMSG client to AP audio server).

Build
-----

```bash
./build.sh boards/best2003_ep/aos_evb_ax4d/configs/wavetable -j64

# AP is still required for the codec and audio server.
./build.sh boards/best2003_ep/aos_evb_ax4d/configs/bootloader -j64
./build.sh boards/best2003_ep/aos_evb_ax4d/configs/ota -j64
./build.sh boards/best2003_ep/aos_evb_ax4d/configs/ap -j64
```

Put raw single-cycle tables under `/sdcard/wavetable/`.

```text
wtsynth
wtsynth -w /sdcard/wavetable/saw.raw -n 64 -t 3000
```
